## How rules and hooks reach a session

- **CLAUDE.md**: ancestors load at launch; a subdirectory `CLAUDE.md` loads
  when the agent first reads a file in that subtree. Not re-injected after
  `/compact` until a file there is read again.
- **`.claude/settings.json`** is read from the session's project root ONLY.
  So an identical copy of `.claude/hooks/` sits here and in every repo, and
  each hook finds the owning repo itself.
- **`.claude/harness.conf`** names the repos and commands. Hooks read it; edit
  it, never the hooks.

